## Local dev

```bash
# Install the framework in editable mode (Phase 0 — local-only).
uv venv --python 3.11
uv sync

# Pre-flight probe (no writes; safe to run repeatedly):
lake-ingest doctor --env dev

# Add a source registration:
vim config/sources/<your_source>.yaml
lake-ingest config sync --env dev --apply

# Discover datasets from the source:
lake-ingest discover --source <your_source> --apply

# Generate ADF artifacts:
lake-ingest deploy --realm azure-databricks-adf --env dev --apply
```

